# Environment

Copy to `.env.local` and set only what you want switched on. Anything left unset
is reported as off (`GET /health`, and the pills on /board) and the pipeline stops
at that step, naming the variable — nothing is substituted for it.

## Backend (Convex)

```
# Set automatically by `npx convex dev` when a deployment is linked:
CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=
```

## Web

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=
```

## Webhooks: verify the sender

```
VAPI_WEBHOOK_SECRET=          # also sent on tool calls; without it /hooks/vapi-* refuse
RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET=        # without it /hooks/inbound-email refuses
```

## Vendors

```
OPENAI_API_KEY=               # transcript -> claims
OPENAI_EXTRACTION_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=            # read the counterparty's own pages
FIRECRAWL_BASE_URL=https://api.firecrawl.dev/v2

SCORECARD_API_KEY=            # second opinion on a graded call
SCORECARD_BASE_URL=https://api2.scorecard.io/api/v2

AUTUMN_SECRET_KEY=            # meter a passing call
AUTUMN_BASE_URL=https://api.useautumn.com/v1
AUTUMN_FEATURE_ID=verified_resolution

# Mail: a mailbox that can also receive is preferred, because the counterparty's
# reply is evidence and a one-way sender can never deliver one.
AGENTMAIL_API_KEY=            # preferred
AGENTMAIL_INBOX_ID=           # the inbox the case writes from, e.g. cases@...
AGENTMAIL_WEBHOOK_SECRET=     # also refuses unsigned deliveries to /hooks/agentmail
AGENTMAIL_BASE_URL=https://api.agentmail.to/v0

RESEND_API_KEY=               # fallback sender (cannot receive)
RESEND_FROM=                  # required together with the key
RESEND_BASE_URL=https://api.resend.com
RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
OWNER_EMAIL=                  # where the call report goes

INKEEP_API_KEY=               # grounded answers on the line
INKEEP_MODEL=inkeep-rag
INKEEP_BASE_URL=https://api.inkeep.com/v1

VAPI_API_KEY=                 # place the call
VAPI_PUBLIC_KEY=              # for browser calls
VAPI_ASSISTANT_ID=
VAPI_SERVER_URL=              # <site>/hooks/vapi-tools
VAPI_BASE_URL=https://api.vapi.ai

# Shared secrets are ours to generate, not the vendor's:
#   openssl rand -hex 24
USER_AGENT=                   # some vendor APIs refuse a scripted client
```

## Overriding an endpoint

Every base URL above can be overridden, so a path that has moved can be corrected
without touching code. `convex/integrations/endpoints.ts` is the single place they
are declared, and each carries a note about where its shape came from.
